      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-123482",
      ":question/problem": "Let $R = [2, 4] \\cdot [1, 5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $P$ be a partition of $R$, where\n\n$P_{1} = {x_{0}, x_{1}, \u2026, x_{m}}, P_{2} = {y_{0}, y_{1}, \u2026, y_{n}}, P = P_{1} \\cdot P_{2}$.\n\nCalculate the double integral\n\n$\u222c_(R)f(x, y)dA$,\n\nwhere $f$ is a function such that $m_{ij} = M_{ij} = 5$ for all partitions $P$ of $R$, and $m_{ij}$ and $M_{ij}$ are the minimum and maximum values of $f$ respectively in each subregion $R_{ij}$."
